  <p>The calculators and articles on this site are provided free, for styling reference and general interest. A body shape label describes a relationship between circumferences under published rules; it is not medical, nutritional or health advice, and no result here should be used to make health decisions. The waist-to-hip percentile describes where a ratio sits among a measured sample and is not a diagnosis.</p>
  <p>The rules and figures are reproduced from the sources cited on each page in good faith; errors may exist, and the site may change or withdraw content at any time. Nothing on this site is a warranty of accuracy.</p>
  <p>Content may be quoted with a link to the source page. Systematic copying is not permitted.</p>
  <p>Questions: <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a></p>
  <p class="muted">Last updated 2026-09-15.</p>
